528821304096","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1222620-1827626365766858","game_id":"steam-1222620","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.5.1 - NARNOK has a Steam Demo","summary":"March 2026 The first Steam demo for Narnok is live.v0.5.1 also rolls in a big pass on enemy previews, sell feedback, cycle flow, and battle presentation.Play the demo on Steam First public Steam demo build New Steam capsule and logo assets Here's look at our artist building the new Steam artwork.Opponent selection is much easier to read before you commit. Preview up to 3 opponents side-by-side Preview cards now show an enemy lineup strip before commit Pre-commit lineup strips reveal some active ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-24T21:45:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365766858","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1222620-1826992588597346","game_id":"steam-1222620","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.5 - NARNOK has cycles","summary":"March 2026 v0.5 adds cycles, site combining, site discovery, and a new card batch.Win at tier `5` to complete a cycle. Each new cycle starts one tier lower: cycle `1` starts at `4`, cycle `2` starts at `3`, cycle `3` starts at `2` Cycle `1 -> 2` lets you keep `5` sites Cycle `2 -> 3` lets you keep `8` sites Win the last cycle to win the run! The transition forces you to choose which `5` sites carry forward.Compatible sites can now combine. New combined sites: `Asupaloopa`, `Egger`, `Winstor`, `L","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-14T05:33:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588597346","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","con